<title>USA: Sun Chemical consolidates operations in Chile.</title>
<headline>Sun Chemical consolidates operations in Chile.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LEE, N.J. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Chemical Latin America, a unit of  Sun Chemical Corp, Friday said it has consolidated its operations in Chile under the name Sun Chemical Chile SA.</p>
<p>The move joins Quimica Flesch SA, Indutinta SA and Aquaprint SAS under the newly-formed business umbrella.</p>
<p>Sun Chemical manufacturers printing inks, organic pigments and is a supplier of graphic arts plates and films.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
